      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reads the PDF into the text, tables and\nfigures that every other step works from.\n\nRuns on: Docling; VLM_MODEL corrects misread\ntables\n\nWrites: documents/<paper>/main|supplement:\nanchored.md, anchors.json, tables/, images/\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Reads the PDF into the text, tables and\nfigures that every other step works from.\n\nRuns on: Docling; VLM_MODEL corrects misread\ntables\n\nWrites: documents/<paper>/main|supplement:\nanchored.md, anchors.json, tables/, images/\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
