      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Finds the title, authors, journal and year,\nand matches the paper to its PubMed record.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL + PubMed\n\nWrites: papers: title, authors, journal, year,\nPMID, disease name\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Finds the title, authors, journal and year,\nand matches the paper to its PubMed record.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL + PubMed\n\nWrites: papers: title, authors, journal, year,\nPMID, disease name\n\nScope: whole paper",
