      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Finds the genetic variants the paper reports,\nwritten as the paper writes them.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: variants rows as written: hgvs, type,\nfunctional evidence; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Finds the genetic variants the paper reports,\nwritten as the paper writes them.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: variants rows as written: hgvs, type,\nfunctional evidence; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
