      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Looks at every figure, says which show a\npedigree or genotyping evidence (Sanger\ntraces, gels, copy-number plots, read pileups,\nkaryotypes or FISH), and describes those for\nthe later steps.\n\nRuns on: VLM_MODEL\n\nWrites: figure_descriptions: kind, caption,\ndescription per readable figure\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Looks at every figure, says which show a\npedigree or genotyping evidence (Sanger\ntraces, gels, copy-number plots, read pileups,\nkaryotypes or FISH), and describes those for\nthe later steps.\n\nRuns on: VLM_MODEL\n\nWrites: figure_descriptions: kind, caption,\ndescription per readable figure\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
