      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Identifies each patient the paper describes,\nmarks the probands and groups patients into\nfamilies.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: patients (identifier, proband status),\nfamilies; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Identifies each patient the paper describes,\nmarks the probands and groups patients into\nfamilies.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: patients (identifier, proband status),\nfamilies; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
