      "text": "Fills in each patient's sex, ages, ancestry,\naffected status and relationship to the\nproband.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per patient\n\nWrites: patients: sex, ages, onset, country,\nancestry, race, affected status, relationship\n\nScope: per patient",
