      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collects what the paper says about whether\nvariants track with disease in each family,\nsuch as LOD scores.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per family\n\nWrites: segregation_evidence: LOD score,\nstatements, per family\n\nScope: per family",
      "originalText": "Collects what the paper says about whether\nvariants track with disease in each family,\nsuch as LOD scores.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per family\n\nWrites: segregation_evidence: LOD score,\nstatements, per family\n\nScope: per family",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
