      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Converts each variant to standard coordinates\nand identifiers (HGVS, rsID, ClinGen allele)\nusing ClinVar, the Allele Registry and\nVariantValidator.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL + ClinVar, Allele\nRegistry, VariantValidator; per variant\n\nWrites: variants: harmonized HGVS g/c/p, rsID,\nCAid, coordinates\n\nScope: per variant",
      "originalText": "Converts each variant to standard coordinates\nand identifiers (HGVS, rsID, ClinGen allele)\nusing ClinVar, the Allele Registry and\nVariantValidator.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL + ClinVar, Allele\nRegistry, VariantValidator; per variant\n\nWrites: variants: harmonized HGVS g/c/p, rsID,\nCAid, coordinates\n\nScope: per variant",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
