      "text": "Adds predictions and scores, such as SpliceAI,\nto each harmonized variant.\n\nRuns on: tools (SpliceAI, gnomAD), per variant\n\nWrites: variants: annotation columns\n\nScope: per variant",
      "originalText": "Adds predictions and scores, such as SpliceAI,\nto each harmonized variant.\n\nRuns on: tools (SpliceAI, gnomAD), per variant\n\nWrites: variants: annotation columns\n\nScope: per variant",
