      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Links each patient to the variants they carry,\nwith inheritance and testing details.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: patient_variant_occurrences: zygosity,\ninheritance mechanism, variant inheritance,\ntesting methods, disease name; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
      "originalText": "Links each patient to the variants they carry,\nwith inheritance and testing details.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL\n\nWrites: patient_variant_occurrences: zygosity,\ninheritance mechanism, variant inheritance,\ntesting methods, disease name; flags\n\nScope: whole paper",
