      "text": "Works out whether a patient's two variants sit\non opposite copies of the gene (compound\nheterozygous).\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per patient\n\nWrites: occurrence pairing\n(paired_occurrence_id); flags\n\nScope: per patient",
