      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pulls each patient's clinical features out of\nthe text as the paper describes them.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per patient\n\nWrites: phenotypes: concept, onset, severity,\nnegated/uncertain, per patient\n\nScope: per patient",
      "originalText": "Pulls each patient's clinical features out of\nthe text as the paper describes them.\n\nRuns on: EXTRACTION_MODEL, per patient\n\nWrites: phenotypes: concept, onset, severity,\nnegated/uncertain, per patient\n\nScope: per patient",
