      "text": "Matches each patient's clinical features to\nstandard HPO terms.\n\nRuns on: LINKING_MODEL, per phenotype\n\nWrites: hpos: candidate HPO terms with\nconfidence; HPO link cache\n\nScope: per phenotype",
