      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Matches the disease named for a patient-\nvariant pair to a MONDO disease term.\n\nRuns on: LINKING_MODEL, per occurrence\n\nWrites: patient_variant_occurrences: MONDO id\nfor the link's disease name\n\nScope: per patient-variant occurrence",
      "originalText": "Matches the disease named for a patient-\nvariant pair to a MONDO disease term.\n\nRuns on: LINKING_MODEL, per occurrence\n\nWrites: patient_variant_occurrences: MONDO id\nfor the link's disease name\n\nScope: per patient-variant occurrence",
