      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each box is one pipeline step; an arrow is \"when this completes, queue that\",\nlabelled with what the next step is given. Dashed arrows: Extraction Verification\nis queued by the worker once every other task of the paper has settled.\nFill colour is the scope a step runs over: one task row per paper, patient, ...",
